WEBVTT

00:08:19.707 --> 00:08:56.645
★Emily has a younger brother named Sam. He is very curious and always wants to play with Emily’s toys. Emily gets frustrated because Sam often takes her things without asking. Her mother told her that she should teach Sam to ask before taking anything. She decided to explain to him that taking things without permission is not polite, and that she will let him play with her toys if he asks first.
☆☆Question: Why does Emily get frustrated?
